  "description": "A boy who lived in a different world from hers but had the same scars, and so could never hate her. Twenty-nine-year-old Hee-Rim reunited with Park Gun, who had become a gangster. \n\n*“You might not care about scars, but you actually care a lot.”\n\n“The person I liked really hated having scars on my face.”* \n\nAlthough they were still in a different world, they shared a lost time, and that’s why they entered Hee-Rim’s sturdy castle once again.\n\n *“I thought… there might still be a chance.”*\n\nThe time between the two, which had been at a standstill for 10 years, began to move again. \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
